      "cliffhanger": "The Dowager Duchess whispers desperately, 'What is your husband's name?' just as the scene is about to be interrupted.",
      "why": "A high-stakes identity reveal where a dying matriarch recognizes a hidden royal crest, creating immediate curiosity about the husband's true identity.",
      "context_gap": "Strangers won't know the ring belongs to a lost Duke or why the Duchess is so desperate, but the tension of the question stands alone."
    },
    {
      "title": "Dragged Away in Chains",
      "start_block": "B086",
      "end_block": "B095",
      "hook": "Blond Nobleman coldly snatching the medicine vial from Juliana's hand and ordering, 'Take her.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana is violently dragged backward by a guard, casting a terrified glance at the bed before cutting to black.",
      "why": "Ends on pure physical action and helplessness; the viewer sees the hero captured right after exposing the truth, creating an urgent need to see what happens next.",
